# Backend

Follow `AGENTS.md` sections on clean code, backend, security, DB, BullMQ.

- Thin controllers; logic in services
- Validate inputs; transactions for multi-row writes
- Prisma migrations only (never prod `db push`)
- Use shared API envelope helpers
- Omit answer fields for non-entitled users
- RBAC + IDOR on protected routes
- Jobs idempotent; not for simple CRUD
- Graceful shutdown; never log secrets
